is_admin": false, "score": 61, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8882841, "raw_content": "", "author": "StopCorruptionDC", "created": 1791828082963, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "harryparatestes", "is_video": true, "video_link": "https://cdn.videy.co/ubZCjOp51.mp4", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "cdn.videy.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://cdn.videy.co/ubZCjOp51.mp4", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "AMAZING: Somali Rep. Ilhan Omar\u2019s (D-MN) Washington, D.C. home was hit in a PRE-DAWN raid this morning by Homeland Security Investigations as part of a criminal fraud probe into immigration paperwork her late father filled out when she was a child. DEPORT! DEPORT! DEPORT!", "last_comment_created": 1791828655285, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 61, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVevE5Vw", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 41, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8883040, "raw_content": "> \u201cTrump can\u2019t win the election! It\u2019s RIGGED! We\u2019re DOOMED!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he won, but he won\u2019t actually close the border!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he closed the border, but he won\u2019t start mass deportations!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he started mass deportations, but he won\u2019t cut legal immigration by 3x as much!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he cut legal immigration and achieved net denigration for the first time in history, but he won\u2019t dismantle USAID!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he dismantled USAID, but he won\u2019t get rid of DEI in the federal government!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he got rid of DEI, but he won\u2019t kick transgender troops out of the military!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he did that, but he won\u2019t go after the universities!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he went after the universities, but he won\u2019t bring back manufacturing by impose massive tariffs!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he brought back manufacturing and imposed the tariffs, but he won\u2019t force NATO countries to increase defense spending!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, NATO agreed to 5%, but he won\u2019t prosecute Comey!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, Comey got indicted, but he won\u2019t overthrow Maduro!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he captured Maduro, but he won\u2019t go after Greenland!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, he got Greenland, but he won\u2019t raid Ilhan Omar\u2019s house!\u201d\r\n\r\n> \u201cOk, federal agents raided Omar\u2019s house, but he won\u2019t __________!\u201d **(You are here)**\r\n\r\nNOTE: I could make this list 5x longer but kept it shorter for brevity purposes. You get the point:\r\n\r\n**A doomer shill is never wrong. He just moves the goalposts.**\r\n\r\nEvery victory is immediately forgotten. Every obstacle is proof of \u201cbetrayal.\u201d Every prediction of failure is quietly erased.\r\n\r\nTrump could cure cancer, arrest a Martian, and invade Canada, and these people will still be screaming:\r\n\r\n> \u201cYEAH, BUT HE STILL HASN\u2019T DONE ANYTHING!!!\u201d", "author": "EnforceRuleOne", "created": 1791835730103, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Thatnikcufguy", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "TRUMP WILL NEVER DO ______. Oh, Trump did ______? Ah. Well, nevertheless\u2026", "last_comment_created": 1791836870382, "content": "<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cTrump can\u2019t win the election! It\u2019s RIGGED! We\u2019re DOOMED!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he won, but he won\u2019t actually close the border!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he closed the border, but he won\u2019t start mass deportations!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he started mass deportations, but he won\u2019t cut legal immigration by 3x as much!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he cut legal immigration and achieved net denigration for the first time in history, but he won\u2019t dismantle USAID!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he dismantled USAID, but he won\u2019t get rid of DEI in the federal government!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he got rid of DEI, but he won\u2019t kick transgender troops out of the military!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he did that, but he won\u2019t go after the universities!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he went after the universities, but he won\u2019t bring back manufacturing by impose massive tariffs!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he brought back manufacturing and imposed the tariffs, but he won\u2019t force NATO countries to increase defense spending!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, NATO agreed to 5%, but he won\u2019t prosecute Comey!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, Comey got indicted, but he won\u2019t overthrow Maduro!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he captured Maduro, but he won\u2019t go after Greenland!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, he got Greenland, but he won\u2019t raid Ilhan Omar\u2019s house!\u201d</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u201cOk, federal agents raided Omar\u20